    {
      "turn": 2,
      "doctor_question": "Did this restless feeling start after you began a new medicine or changed the dose of one?",
      "targeted_symptom": null,
      "patient_response": "No, I ain't taking any new pills or nothing. I don't even really like taking medicine, to be honest with you. My aunt Linda, she takes a whole handful of 'em every morning. She’s got one of those plastic boxes with the days of the week on it, you know? Except the letters rubbed off hers, so she's always getting them mixed up. She had this little terrier dog that actually chewed on the Tuesday compartment once. Man, that dog was crazy... always digging holes under the fence. I had to go over there and put some chicken wire down in the dirt so it wouldn't get out into the street. Took me like three hours in the hot sun, and I didn't even have a proper pair of wire cutters, just these rusty old pliers. But uh... what were you asking? Oh, right, my medicine. Nah, I haven't started anything new.",
